WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
This video will show you how to use Seller Central to find products for advertising based on your

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.000
business goals.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Let's look at three different ways to identify products for advertising in Seller Central.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
We'll cover finding new products, managing inventory levels, and building on your successful products.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.143
First goal?

00:00:17.143 --> 00:00:20.000
Increase awareness of new products.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Advertising can help shoppers discover your newly listed products on Amazon.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Let's look at where to find these opportunities in Seller Central.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
To find newly listed products, go to the Seller Central menu,

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.000
select Growth, and select Growth Opportunities.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.794
From the Sell New Products tab, choose Launch Preset Sponsored Products Ad, New ASIN, from the drop-

00:00:41.794 --> 00:00:42.000
down.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.000
This dashboard shows recommendations for products listed in the last 90 days.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.000
The recommendations update daily, and completed recommendations are removed after 24 hours.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Preset Sponsored Products campaigns include pre-populated settings for

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
daily budget, bidding strategy, targeting strategy, and suggested bids.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.000
To review settings, select Launch Preset Sponsored Products Ad.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:09.667
Choose Review and Launch in Ad Console to make adjustments, then launch the campaign in the Ads

00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:10.000
Console.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.143
Second goal?

00:01:11.143 --> 00:01:14.000
Increase sales of existing products.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.000
One strategy is to focus on products with excess inventory.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.500
Using advertising for products with excess inventory can help increase product visibility,

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:28.000
manage inventory levels, and reduce additional storage costs for FBA sellers.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:33.000
To find products with excess inventory, go to Seller Central and select FBA Inventory.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:37.000
Sort your products by estimated excess units to identify opportunities.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.333
Alternative method?

00:01:38.333 --> 00:01:41.000
Go to Growth Opportunities.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:45.000
Select Reduce Costs drop-down and choose Reduce excess inventory.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.000
Sponsored Products Ad.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:47.889
Third goal?

00:01:47.889 --> 00:01:51.000
Build your brand and encourage repeat purchases.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:55.000
Consider advertising products that already show strong performance.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:57.000
To find these, select Reports.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.000
Choose Business Reports.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Open the Brand Performance Report, then sort by Sales Rank to see your top performing products.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:08.273
Advertising high-performing products can help maintain their visibility

00:02:08.273 --> 00:02:13.000
and reach shoppers who may be interested in other products in your catalog.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:17.000
You can also build brand loyalty by advertising your deals and promotions.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:21.737
When you combine deals with advertising, you can help more shoppers discover your promotional offers

00:02:21.737 --> 00:02:23.000
and enjoy your products.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:28.000
To find deal opportunities, go to Advertising, then select Deals.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:33.000
For products with active or upcoming deals, select the Edit drop-down, choose Create Ads,

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:36.000
then follow the prompts to set up your campaign.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.000
Ready to get started?

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Visit Seller Central today at sellercentral.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:40.500
amazon.

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:41.000
com.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.000
Already know what you want to advertise?

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:48.077
Create an account or sign in to Amazon Ads at advertising.

00:02:48.077 --> 00:02:48.538
amazon.

00:02:48.538 --> 00:02:49.000
com.
